              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwaanikin aneni kus akisileerekinet na ka ŋakiro ŋuna eya lokitaabo ŋolo ipucaritae, lokitaabo ŋolo ani keinakin ŋulu eyenete akisyom, elimokinitae ebe, “Tosyoma ekitaabo lo,” etemarete ikes, “Nyikipedori isua, anerae ipucitae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
